            <h2> Explore Popular Places to Visit in <span>Skardu</span></h2>
            <p>
                Tucked away in the breathtaking region of Gilgit-Baltistan, Skardu is one of the most mesmerizing and sought-after tourist destinations in Pakistan. 
                Surrounded by snow-capped mountains, turquoise lakes, and lush valleys, it offers an untouched
                charm that captures the heart of every traveler. Whether you're a passionate nature lover,
                a thrill-seeking adventurer, or a curious cultural explorer, Skardu has something truly 
                special for you. From the majestic peaks of the Karakoram Range to the tranquil beauty of 
                Upper Kachura Lake, the region promises awe-inspiring moments at every turn. It’s not just
                a place to visit — it’s a destination to experience. Here’s your guide to the best places 
                to visit in Skardu and the most memorable activities to enjoy during your stay.
            </p>
