                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Shangrila Resort (Lower Kachura Lake)</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            A picturesque paradise just 20 minutes from Skardu city, Shangrila Resort
                            encircles the stunning Lower Kachura Lake. Known as “Heaven on Earth,” it
                            features lush gardens, colorful cottages, and tranquil waters. The resort
                            is famous for its iconic airplane restaurant and romantic ambiance. It's
                            an ideal getaway for nature lovers, honeymooners, and anyone seeking serenity.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
                    <img src="../Content/Assets/img/popular-places/lakeSkardu.png"
                         alt="photo"
                         class="img-fluid w-100" />
                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Upper Kachura Lake</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            A short trek from Shangrila Resort leads you to Upper Kachura Lake, a hidden gem with unmatched natural beauty. Its deep, clear waters are perfect for boating, trout fishing,
                            and peaceful reflection. Surrounded by apricot orchards and rugged mountains, this untouched location is
                            a photographer's dream. The calm atmosphere makes it an ideal spot to unwind and connect with nature.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
