                         alt="photo"
                         class="img-fluid w-100" />
                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Shigar Fort</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            Shigar Fort is a 400-year-old architectural masterpiece, now beautifully
                            restored into a museum and heritage hotel. Nestled at the base of the
                            Karakoram range, it showcases the elegance of traditional Balti craftsmanship. Visitors
                            can explore its courtyards, museum rooms, and gardens while learning about royal Balti
                            history. It’s a must-visit destination for history buffs and culture enthusiasts.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
