                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Deosai National Park</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            Stretching across vast high-altitude plains, Deosai National Park is the second-highest plateau in the world. Known as the “Land of Giants,”
                            it bursts with wildflowers, rare wildlife, and endless horizons in the summer. The park is home to Himalayan
                            brown bears, golden marmots, and migratory birds. It’s perfect for camping, photography, and experiencing
                            Skardu’s untamed natural beauty.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
