                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Satpara Lake</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            Just 9 km from Skardu, Satpara Lake is a glacial-fed gem that mesmerizes visitors with its 
                            sparkling blue waters. The lake provides boating opportunities and offers some of the best
                            panoramic views of the surrounding mountains. It also serves as a crucial water reservoir 
                            for the city of Skardu. The peaceful
                            vibe and scenic charm make it a favorite for nature lovers.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
                    <img src="../Content/Assets/img/Places & Activites/Manthokha.png"
                         alt="photo"
                         class="img-fluid w-100" />
                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Manthokha Waterfall</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            Located about two hours from Skardu, Manthokha Waterfall is a stunning natural wonder surrounded by
                            green fields and villages. Cascading from a height of 180 feet, its powerful
                            flow is both refreshing and awe-inspiring. The surrounding area is perfect for trout fishing, hiking,
                            and picnic getaways. It offers a beautiful contrast of water, rock, and greenery in one spot.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
                    <img src="../Content/Assets/img/Places & Activites/Khaplu.png"
                         alt="photo"
                         class="img-fluid w-100" />
                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Khaplu Palace</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            A remarkable symbol of Tibetan and Mughal architectural fusion, Khaplu Palace is a cultural 
                            treasure about 2.5 hours from Skardu. The palace has been transformed into a museum and boutique 
                            hotel managed by the Serena group. It tells the story of local royalty and Balti heritage through 
                            guided tours and historic artifacts. 
                            Visitors are treated to timeless charm, majestic views, and authentic hospitality.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
