                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">
                                Cold Desert (Sarfaranga Desert)
                            </a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            The Sarfaranga Desert, also known as the Cold Desert, offers surreal white sand dunes framed 
                            by the snowy Karakoram mountains. It's the only cold desert in Pakistan and a popular spot for
                            jeep safaris, ATV rides, and dune bashing. The dramatic landscapes make it ideal for photography 
                            and sunset views. 
                            Adventure seekers and peace lovers alike will find this spot unforgettable.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
                    <img src="../Content/Assets/img/Places & Activites/Sheosar.png"
                         alt="photo"
                         class="img-fluid w-100" />
                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">
                                Sheosar Lake
                            </a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            Sheosar Lake lies in the heart of Deosai National Park and is considered one of the highest lakes
                            in the world. Its crystal-clear water reflects surrounding wildflower fields and snow-capped peaks, 
                            including Nanga Parbat. The lake is best visited in spring and summer when the terrain comes alive with
                            color and calm. It’s
                            an exceptional place for nature walks, photography, and peaceful meditation.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
